2deff19f2bd898b10e16c8751182e34e.mp4?t=1780393459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>●The girl's lines will be fully voiced!</strong> (Japanese only)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>＜Character Design＞</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiro Kiyohara</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>＜Cast＞</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aoi Hinata</p>", "short_description": "Peek into the sins and memories of five personalities through surveillance cameras──This is an immersive, mystery adventure game that unravels the thoughts of the dark past that lie dormant inside Sofia,a suspect in the murder of a presidential candidate, and uncovers the truth behind the crime.", "supported_languages": "Japanese<strong>*</strong>, English, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326660/header.jpg?t=1780393459", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326660/d05f3d2e2910b0bc3b505aec697d840081ca2a20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780393459", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326660/d05f3d2e2910b0bc3b505aec697d840081ca2a20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780393459", "website": "https://sofia.mutan.co.jp/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel core i5 10500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 5500<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating syste